    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Biographies",
     "texto": [
      "**çocukluk** = childhood; **eğitim** = training; **başarı** = achievement.",
      "**-miş** often appears in biographies to present information known from other sources: **küçük yaşta başlamış** = she started at an early age, according to the biography.",
      "Order the facts with **daha sonra** («later») and **hayatının sonunda** («at the end of her life»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
